  "interpretation": "Deep domain knowledge could help a builder recognise useful observations, design better experiments and avoid wasted actions. Peter_Findley’s human record makes that possibility worth serious attention. The result to watch is whether that judgment becomes a method that adapts to games its author has never seen.",
